<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/AISystem/f1b3a5fe276a> a airo:AISystem ;
    rdfs:label "Stable Diffusion 1.5" ;
    airo:confidenceScore "0.98"^^xsd:float ;
    airo:extractionMode "explicit" ;
    airo:hasDescription "Stable Diffusion 1.5" ;
    airo:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/6e8db9a67b22> ;
    airo:hasSourceDocument <https://w3id.org/airo/incident/document/3354> .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/ba602eede37e> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "As far back as October 2021, cognitive scientist Abeba Birhane, currently a senior fellow in trustworthy AI at Mozilla, published a paper, *Multimodal datasets: misogyny, pornography, and malignant stereotypes*, which examined LAION-400M, an earlier image dataset." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3349" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/7090b415133c> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The alleged distribution of child sexual abuse images on the messaging app Telegram is part of what led French authorities to bring charges on Wednesday against the platform's founder and CEO, Pavel Durov." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3875" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/98529c88538c> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "They conducted the study using PhotoDNA, a Microsoft tool that enables investigators to match digital \"fingerprints\" of the images in question to known pieces of CSAM in databases managed by the National Center for Missing and Exploited Children and the Canadian Centre for Child Protection." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3352" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/fd79afd073bf> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "LAION was scraped, in part, by using visual data from online shopping services such as Shopify, eBay and Amazon." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3349" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/b03aaa6ac2b4> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Ortiz, an award-winning artist who has worked for Industrial Light & Magic (ILM), Marvel Film Studios, Universal Studios and HBO, spoke at a virtual FTC panel in October and discussed the LAION-5B dataset." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3349" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/f17ed4a4b6a8> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "And a class-action lawsuit, *Andersen et al. v. Stability AI LTD et al.*, was brought by visual artists Sarah Andersen, Kelly McKernan, and Karla Ortiz against Stability AI, Midjourney, and DeviantArt in January 2023." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3349" .

